('int-ohs', 'Occupational health (flag only)', 'Occupational health', 'medical due dates and fit flag', 'in', '2026-10-03T05:00:00Z', 72, 'stale', 196, 0, 'Daily', 'Stale: last success more than 72 hours ago. Medical flags show "not yet confirmed".'),
